        MotivationalQuote(id: 1, text: "Be the change that you wish to see in the world.", author: "Mahatma Gandhi"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 2, text: "Darkness cannot drive out darkness: only light can do that. Hate cannot drive out hate: only love can do that.", author: "Martin Luther King Jr."),
