        MotivationalQuote(id: 36, text: "I can't give you a sure-fire formula for success, but I can give you a formula for failure: try to please everybody all the time.", author: "Herbert Bayard Swope"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 37, text: "Happiness is not something ready made. It comes from your own actions.", author: "Dalai Lama XIV"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 38, text: "Who controls the past controls the future. Who controls the present controls the past.", author: "George Orwell"),
