        MotivationalQuote(id: 63, text: "Take responsibility of your own happiness, never put it in other people’s hands.", author: "Roy T. Bennett"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 64, text: "Accept yourself, love yourself, and keep moving forward. If you want to fly, you have to give up what weighs you down.", author: "Roy T. Bennett"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 65, text: "Waiting is painful. Forgetting is painful. But not knowing which to do is the worst kind of suffering.", author: "Paulo Coelho"),
