        MotivationalQuote(id: 168, text: "I don't think of all the misery, but of the beauty that still remains.", author: "Anne Frank"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 169, text: "My concern is not whether God is on our side; my greatest concern is to be on God's side, for God is always right.", author: "Abraham Lincoln"),
