        MotivationalQuote(id: 198, text: "In the end\nthese things matter most:\nHow well did you love?\nHow fully did you live?\nHow deeply did you let go?", author: "Jack Kornfield"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 199, text: "I'd rather be hated for who I am, than loved for who I am not.", author: "Kurt Cobain"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 200, text: "Parents can only give good advice or put them on the right paths, but the final forming of a person's character lies in their own hands.", author: "Anne Frank"),
