        MotivationalQuote(id: 212, text: "The desire to reach for the stars is ambitious. The desire to reach hearts is wise.", author: "Maya Angelou"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 213, text: "It is easy in the world to live after the world's opinion; it is easy in solitude to live after our own; but the great man is he who in the midst of the crowd keeps with perfect sweetness the independence of solitude.", author: "Ralph Waldo Emerson"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 214, text: "Believe in your infinite potential. Your only limitations are those you set upon yourself.", author: "Roy T. Bennett"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 215, text: "However many holy words you read, however many you speak, what good will they do you if you do not act on upon them?", author: "Buddha"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 216, text: "Do not set aside your happiness. Do not wait to be happy in the future. The best time to be happy is always now.", author: "Roy T. Bennett"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 217, text: "A concept is a brick. It can be used to build a courthouse of reason. Or it can be thrown through the window.", author: "Gilles Deleuze"),
        MotivationalQuote(id: 218, text: "Happiness is not the absence of problems, it's the ability to deal with them.", author: "Steve Maraboli"),
